'' A TARGET WORD IS CASE-BLIND, as the manifest is: '[target.ApexWealth2026]' is stored
'' lowercased, and 'tiko build ApexWealth2026' was TKO0160 'no target named' (ApexWealth
'' AW-001). Here 'MISSING' reaches target 'missing', whose own error follows. See Classify_ in
'' build/subcmd.tiko and ProfileExists in build/plan.tiko.
'' TEST: cli
'' ARGS: build --manifest tests/diagnostics/src/build-bad MISSING
'' EXPECT-EXIT: 2
'' EXPECT-OUT: error TKO0162: target 'missing'
'' EXPECT-NOT: TKO0160
